99
00:09:52,940 --> 00:09:57,940
So this is the first thing.

100
00:09:57,940 --> 00:10:00,420
And the second thing is--

101
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:07,520
so this was, since fn
converges to f uniformly.

102
00:10:11,900 --> 00:10:14,460
The second thing is that--

103
00:10:14,460 --> 00:10:18,260
so now we have n.

104
00:10:18,260 --> 00:10:22,140
This here holds for all n
bigger or equal to capital N.

105
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:25,940
But in particular, it holds
