110
00:11:22,130 --> 00:11:27,890
then this function-- the value
at these two points differ

111
00:11:27,890 --> 00:11:29,970
at most--

112
00:11:29,970 --> 00:11:33,490
so this is for the fn.

113
00:11:33,490 --> 00:11:38,210
The value at these two
points differ at most

114
00:11:38,210 --> 00:11:42,970
by epsilon over 3.

115
00:11:42,970 --> 00:11:47,600
So again, we have
a sequence, fn,

116
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:50,360
that converges
uniformly to some f.

117
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:53,400
We want to prove that
this f is continuous.

118
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:57,080
So we just need to prove
