119
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,960
it's continuous at x0.

120
00:11:59,960 --> 00:12:02,120
First, I'm using
that the sequence

121
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:04,520
is converging uniformly.

122
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:08,080
So given this epsilon,
there exists this capital N

123
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:11,120
so that if you're further
