127
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,580
and it's continuous at x0.

128
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:28,600
So I have this.

129
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:32,160
And so now we need to estimate--

130
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:36,760
we now need to estimate
the difference.

131
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:39,280
So what we're
really interested is

132
00:12:39,280 --> 00:12:42,920
in f, but the f
capital N, that's

133
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:47,120
going to help us estimate the
difference between these two

134
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:48,880
numbers.

135
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:50,580
And so these two numbers--

136
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:56,120
so x here, x0 was
this fixed point

