156
00:14:12,910 --> 00:14:16,670
And so now we use the
triangle inequality,

157
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:19,910
that this is now
bounded by f of x

158
00:14:19,910 --> 00:14:32,270
minus fN of x plus fN of x minus
f capital N of x0, like that,

