163
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:56,160
and the convergence was uniform.

164
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:59,460
So it really was
the first part here.

165
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:04,620
So that is less
than epsilon over 3.

166
00:15:04,620 --> 00:15:10,260
This one here comes from that
the difference between x and x0

167
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:14,940
is less than delta
and that this function

168
00:15:14,940 --> 00:15:18,660
fN was continuous at x0.

169
00:15:18,660 --> 00:15:21,600
So this is another
